Third-party test data in this component. Paths are relative to this
directory.

The files under `tests/data/acvp-ml-kem/original/` are from the National
Institute of Standards and Technology's ACVP-Server repository and are
reproduced unchanged; `tests/data/acvp-ml-kem/mlkem1024-acvp-fixture.json` is a
data fixture derived from them by re-arrangement. Those files retain their
accompanying notices and terms, which are reproduced with their provenance in
`tests/data/acvp-ml-kem/PROVENANCE.md`. This does not extend to the project's
own test code or to the extraction script in that directory.
